:solution
$()	Calculons la dérivée de 
!insmath f
$()&nbsp;: <span class="nowrap">
!insmath f^{\prime}(x)=$val40
$().</span><br>	On cherche donc 
!insmath x_1
$() solution de <span class="nowrap">
!insmath $val18 = $val19
$().</span><br>	
